==English==
{{was wotd|2008|July|10}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*mend-}}
From {{uder|en|la|mendīcāns}}, present participle of {{m|la|mendīcō||beg}}. Compare {{cog|fr|mendiant}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈmɛn.dɪ.kənt/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-mendicant.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# Depending on [[alms]] for a [[living]].
# Of or pertaining to a [[beggar]].
# Of or pertaining to a member of a [[religious]] order forbidden to own property, and who must [[beg]] for a living.

